  "name": "Zestaw Upominkowy z Winem Hiszpańskim",
  "description": "<p style=\"line-height:16px;margin-bottom:0.1cm;background-image:none;background-position:0% 0%;background-size:auto;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;margin-top:0.1cm;border:medium;padding:0cm;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Wino czerwone Hiszpańskie 750 ml</span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:16px;margin-bottom:0.1cm;background-image:none;background-position:0% 0%;background-size:auto;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;margin-top:0.1cm;border:medium;padding:0cm;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Niederegger wiśnie w czekoladzie 108g</span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:16px;margin-bottom:0.1cm;background-image:none;background-position:0% 0%;background-size:auto;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;margin-top:0.1cm;border:medium;padding:0cm;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Reber Marcepan w czekoladzie 120g</span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:16px;margin-bottom:0.1cm;background-image:none;background-position:0% 0%;background-size:auto;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;margin-top:0.1cm;border:medium;padding:0cm;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Greckie Oliwki Kalamata 360g</span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:16px;margin-bottom:0.1cm;background-image:none;background-position:0% 0%;background-size:auto;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;margin-top:0.1cm;border:medium;padding:0cm;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Cebulki Borettane w occie balsamicznym 280g</span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:16px;margin-bottom:0.1cm;background-image:none;background-position:0% 0%;background-size:auto;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;margin-top:0.1cm;border:medium;padding:0cm;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Chutney z Mango do sera 150g</span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:16px;margin-bottom:0.1cm;background-image:none;background-position:0% 0%;background-size:auto;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;margin-top:0.1cm;border:medium;padding:0cm;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Mus z Foire Gras z Figami 100g</span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:16px;margin-bottom:0.1cm;background-image:none;background-position:0% 0%;background-size:auto;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;margin-top:0.1cm;border:medium;padding:0cm;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Kartofelki Marcepanowe 100g</span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:16px;margin-bottom:0.1cm;background-image:none;background-position:0% 0%;background-size:auto;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;margin-top:0.1cm;border:medium;padding:0cm;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Czekolada Lindt 100g</span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:18.4px;margin-bottom:0.1cm;background-image:none;background-position:0% 0%;background-size:auto;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;margin-top:0.1cm;border:medium;padding:0cm;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Dekoracja świąteczna</span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:18.4px;margin-bottom:0.1cm;background-image:none;background-position:0% 0%;background-size:auto;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;margin-top:0.1cm;border:medium;padding:0cm;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Pudełko Prezentowe</span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:18.4px;margin-bottom:0.1cm;background-image:none;background-position:0% 0%;background-size:auto;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;margin-top:0.1cm;border:medium;padding:0cm;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Logo firmy /bilecik</span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:18.4px;margin-bottom:0.1cm;background-image:none;background-position:0% 0%;background-size:auto;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;margin-top:0.1cm;border:medium;padding:0cm;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Konfekcjonowanie</span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:18.4px;margin-bottom:0.25cm;background-image:none;background-position:0% 0%;background-size:auto;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;\"><strong>Szanowni Państwo,</strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:18.4px;margin-bottom:0.25cm;background-image:none;background-position:0% 0%;background-size:auto;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;\"><strong>uprzejmie informujemy, że zdjęcia mają charakter poglądowy. Zastrzegamy sobie prawo do modyfikacji asortymentu w zależności od jego dostępności. Dziękujemy za wyrozumiałość!</strong></p>\n<p></p>",
  "description_short": "<p>Odkryj idealny prezent z naszymi koszami upominkowymi!</p>\n<p>Szukasz wyjątkowego upominku na specjalną okazję? Nasze luksusowe kosze upominkowe to doskonały sposób, aby zaskoczyć swoich bliskich! W selekcji znajdziesz atrakcyjne zestawy, które zachwycą zarówno smakiem, jak i atrakcyjnym wyglądem. Od świąt po urodziny — nasze kosze są idealnym rozwiązaniem na każdą okazję! </p>\n<p>Zamów już dziś i spraw, aby Twoje prezenty były niezapomniane!</p>\n<p></p>",
